/apps/e2e/incidents/

# Output of apps/e2e/scripts/lesson-perf.mjs and lesson-tiles.mjs: one run's numbers.
# They are ephemeral measurement data; the ones that matter are written into
# docs/PERFORMANCE.md, so the raw files stay out of the tree.
/lesson-perf.json
/lesson-perf-after.json
/lesson-tiles.json
/lesson-tiles-after.json
/lesson-tiles-base.json
/lesson-join-timing*.json
/board-open-time.json
/rep-anon-*.json
/rep-fra-*.json
/lesson-join-timing*.json
/board-open-time.json
/rep-anon-*.json
/rep-fra-*.json

# cwv-perf.mjs: лабораторные прогоны LCP/CLS; метод и ориентиры описаны в docs/PERFORMANCE.md,
# сырой прогон в дерево не попадает (как и lesson-perf.json).
/cwv-perf.json
